5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm so excited to see the proposals! But first, I want to see where our money actually goes. I'll check the transport costs and mount-making charges!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I believe we need to be realistic about our current capacity. I'll look into the conservation lab staffing and backlog, and the composition of the volunteer roster.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,Logic suggests we prioritize actual results over curator ambition. I'll examine the weekend head counts across ten seasons and five years of visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I am concerned about the physical limits of the gallery. I will look into the structural survey of the suspended bay and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is always a pleasure to work with you all. I want to make sure our guests aren't disappointed, so I'll check the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the maintenance log.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, do you think the volunteers are feeling overwhelmed? I hope we can make this exhibition a fun experience for everyone involved!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,It is a possibility. I want to ensure that the burden of execution doesn't fall on a few exhausted individuals.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, enthusiasm is fine, but it doesn't fill seats. We need to understand why certain ""prestigious"" shows failed to attract repeat visitors.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, numbers are useful, but they are irrelevant if the building cannot physically support the installation. Safety and structural integrity must come first.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, let's not fret. We have plenty of time to find a balance that makes everyone happy. I'm just worried about those poor visitors waiting at the door.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, you're so serious! But you're right. I just don't want us to be surprised by a huge bill at the end of the season again.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with Asuka on the importance of limits. However, the human limit is just as critical as the structural one.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, @Asuka, you both focus on the ""how."" I am focusing on the ""why."" If the public doesn't care, the structural integrity is a moot point.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, that is a dangerous way to think. A failure in the suspended bay would be a catastrophe, regardless of how many people wanted to see the art.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,You all have such passionate hearts. It's wonderful. I'll just keep an eye on the logistics so we can all sleep soundly at night.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I think we've all picked our focus! I can't wait to see what we find out. Let's make this the best exhibition ever!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I look forward to the data. It will help us make a rational choice.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,Indeed. Let's see if the records tell a different story than the curators' brochures.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. I will analyze the structural data carefully.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I'll be waiting with a smile. Let's see what the archives have to tell us.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
