35,2,1,talk,Mio,,Oh wow! I found out that shipping and custom mounts are eating up a huge chunk of our budget! We should pick something that doesn't cost a fortune to move.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The situation is more precarious than I feared. The conservation lab is severely understaffed, and our volunteers are mostly part-time guides, not exhibition assistants.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,Interesting. The data shows that static displays are boring. People return when there is human interaction or dynamic elements in the room.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The structural survey is alarming. The suspended bay has a strict weight limit, and the maintenance log shows that powered displays are frequently failing.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,My goodness. It seems we've had quite a few hiccups with shipping deadlines and those powered displays breaking down. We must be very careful this time.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, if the powered displays are breaking, maybe we should avoid them? But @Shion says people like dynamic things! This is tricky!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, @Shion, we cannot prioritize ""dynamic"" elements if we have no one to maintain them. The lab is drowning in a backlog. We cannot afford a high-maintenance show.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, a ""safe"" show is a forgotten show. If we only do what is easy, we are just a warehouse, not a museum. We need a draw.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, your ""draw"" cannot come at the cost of the building's safety. The suspended bay is already at its limit. We cannot accept heavy installations.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"It sounds like we are all worried about different things. Perhaps we can find a proposal that is simple enough to be reliable, but lovely enough to be enjoyed.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,I agree with Shizue! Let's look for something that doesn't need fancy mounts or expensive shipping. That would save so much money for other things!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"I must insist that we consider the staff. If we choose a complex exhibition, the few remaining staff members will be pushed to a breaking point.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, the staff's fatigue is a management issue, not a curation issue. The public's boredom, however, is a failure of the museum's mission.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, a structural collapse is also a failure of the museum's mission. I will not support any proposal that puts heavy loads in the suspended bay.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,Let's remember to be kind to one another. We all want the museum to succeed. Let's look at the candidates with these concerns in mind.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I'm ready! I'll be voting for the one that looks the most budget-friendly and easy to set up.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I will vote for the proposal that requires the least amount of specialized labor and conservation work.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,"I will vote for the one that actually gives people a reason to come back. I'm tired of ""perfect"" shows that are empty.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I will vote for the proposal that is physically lightweight and avoids unstable powered mechanisms.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"I shall vote for the one that is most likely to arrive on time and stay working. I don't want to see any more ""closed for maintenance"" signs.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
